    "text": "By Burt Mummolo ,\n1 hours ago TULSA, (Okla.) — Three weeks ago, Gus Oliver was giving us a tour of a no man's land behind his property. \"We don’t know who owns it,\" he said. Despite that mystery of ownership, Gus had been cited by code enforcement for not maintaining an area adjacent to Hudson Ave, which is a considerable distance from the rear fence of his property. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
